 visual:{type:'flow',title:'AN ORIGINAL PRACTICE ROUTINE',nodes:[['Notice','What is happening, including my reaction?'],['Understand','What evidence, concern and need should I hear?'],['Respond','Choose an action suited to urgency and authority.']],caption:'Community-style learning heuristic, not an official PMI sequence. Urgent safety actions can take precedence.'},
