 visual:{type:'flow',title:'ASSISTANCE → EVIDENCE → DECISION',nodes:[['Draft','Use an approved tool with suitable information.'],['Verify','Check claims, omissions, bias and source evidence.'],['Decide','Apply context and retain accountable ownership.']],caption:'An original learning workflow. AI support is not independent decision authority or an official answer key.'},
