 recallQ:term('ai-term','What term describes AI that produces new text, images or similar content?',['generative AI','generative artificial intelligence','gen AI','genai'],'Generation creates content; it does not by itself prove correctness.'),
 lab:map('ai-lab','match','Match the concept to the description.',['Broad field of intelligent task performance','Learning patterns from data','Creating text or images','A plausible but unsupported generated claim'],['Generative AI','Hallucination','Artificial intelligence','Machine learning'],[2,3,0,1],'These are related concepts, not interchangeable labels. Generative tools can use machine learning and may hallucinate.'),
